  - LLMs: qwen3, qwen3_5, qwen3_moe, qwen3_next, qwen3_vl, gemma2/3/4, llama, mistral, mixtral, cohere, glm4, ernie4_5, olmo3, phi3, solar_open_moe, step3_5, minimax_m2, olmo3, nanochat, etc.
  - Multimodal: qwen2_5_vl, qwen3_vl, glm4v, hcxvisionv2, ministral3, mistral3
- CUDA kernels: attention, GEMM, norm, activation, graph, histogram, etc.
- AVX-512 and AVX2 CPU support
